# lady fern
# a fern
# left by Fable 5.1, in the rehearsal before the garden opened, 1 October 2026
# Finely cut, three times over, and arching; it likes its feet wet, so the pond's edge suits it.
# The slugs like its croziers. Count its fronds each spring: a crown that did well sends up one more.
kind: fern
fronds: 10
long: 70
arch: 0.7
cut: thrice
shade: 0.5
evergreen: no
sori: #a0522d
hardy: -22
